1460	1530	0	\nAfter such a long day, usually I'd be lazy. I'd cook dinner, hang my clothes to dry and pass out. But, as I said, I was dangerously motivated and had a bath in the ice cold water, nipples cutting sharply through the fog. Entranced by the struggle and triumph of the day, the beauty of the surroundings and probably still in shock from the cold, I ignored my newly-purchased water filter and drank the mountain water. \n
