364974	4911	0	\nAnd that's the difference. \n
365287	4939	0	Many people, quite reasonably, draw the line at discomfort. When they're sick, they want a warm bed and good food. When they're in a new place, they take some time to orient themselves. Orient themselves. Somehow, in my case, it's different. I know that the best stories happen in discomfort and have a rocky relationship with my body {{better phrasing}}. 
365310	5295	0	I draw the line 
365343	5311	1	I set the bar somewhere else. For me, a day where I don't eat can be a good day and a good story. Where I'm harassed by police. Where I'm scammed. As long as I come out alive, healthy and not too traumatised, I'm happy. \n
365356	5293	18	, so 
